<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
</head>
<body>
  <h1>You're invited to join <%= @account.name %></h1>

  <p><%= @inviter.name %> has invited you to collaborate on meal planning in MealSzn.</p>

  <p>As a member, you'll be able to create and share recipes, build meal plans together, and more.</p>

  <% if Identity.exists?(email_address: @invitation.email_address) %>
    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666;">If you already have recipes in another account, they can be transferred to your new account when you join.</p>
  <% end %>

  <p>
    <a href="<%= @accept_url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #C05621; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold;">
      Accept Invitation
    </a>
  </p>

  <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666;">This invitation expires in 7 days. If you didn't expect this email, you can safely ignore it.</p>

  <p>Thanks,<br>The MealSzn Team</p>
</body>
</html>
